  "notes": "USAGE:\n{諮問|しもん} is used in governmental and institutional settings. The typical process is: a leader or authority figure {諮問|しもん}s (consults) an advisory body, which then produces a {答申|とうしん} (formal recommendation).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {諮問機関|しもんきかん} (advisory body)\n- {諮問委員会|しもんいいんかい} (advisory committee)\n- {諮問|しもん}に{応|おう}じる (to respond to a consultation)\n- {答申|とうしん} (formal recommendation in response to a consultation)",
